Firstly, families where 5 or more children are brought up are completely exempt from the transport tax.
In this case the budget in this case loses 3.5 million - but the same is saved by large-season parents.
Secondly, and this is the most important thing, those who will adopt 3 or more toddlers, from the new year will issue subsidies for housing.
For each member of the family, a new law provides for 18 square meter, at a price of 30 thousand per meter.
The family, for example, out of 6 - a father, a mother's mother, a native child, and adopted.
For them, according to the standards, the state acquires housing with an area of 108 square meter - for 3 million 300 thousand rubles.
