Baumgertner Nominated to Uralkali
The Current Board of Directors of Uralkali offered the candidacy of General Director Vladislav Baumgertner arrested in Minsk in a new board, according to the website of the Russian company.
Babugertner was included in the list of 11 people nominated to the new board of directors.
