The Chairman of the Krasnoyarsk court kidnapproved a certificate, hitting him on the head
Unknown attacked the Chairman of the Krasnoyarsk regional court Vladimir Divokonko, abducting his identity card.
According to “Interfax”, Late in the evening on Wednesday, the attackers hit the referee on the to the head, why he lost consciousness.
