In Ivanovo opened the VII Interregional Exhibition "Medicine and health"
Inter-regional exhibition "Medicine and health - 2013" was opened on the basis of the sports and entertainment complex "Olympia".
In the solemn opening of the Event was attended by the First Deputy Chairman of the Government of the Ivanovo region Olga Khasbulatova took part.
At the exhibition presents the work of the regional budgetary health care institutions of the Ivanovo region, as well as commercial medical institutions of the regions of Central Russia.
Within the framework of the exhibition will be held seminars, round tables, presentations.
In the course of the work of the exhibition, the work of a mobile complex (full diagnosing), a mobile fluorographer, a blood transfusion station was organized.
Everyone will will be able to receive free diagnostic procedures, consultations of specialists, take part in a master class on physical therapy, to get acquainted with the range of services provided in medical institutions of the Ivanovo region.
In addition, during the exhibition, the Donor's Duty Day takes place.
The general concept of "Medicine and health - 2013" is a prophylactic direction in medicine, promotion of a healthy way of life.
The exhibition presents medical goods and services, equipment, pharmaceutical and medicines that increase the quality of life.
