Efficiency allowance for a family of one-of-four is reduced by $ 36 per a month
From Friday in the U.S. has been reducing the financial provision of product coupons, known as the “Fudstempa”, since the relevant state program ends.
For the food allowance of a family of four people will now spend $ 36 a month less than before, officials said.
