Acrossimilation of the European Union, parties that oppose the EU or for the awknowledge the euro as a single currency are gaining strength.
“Europefully in Germany, the Alternative for Germany party – founded only this year – came out of nowhere and received almost five million votes in the September federal elections, thus essentially squeezing “Free Democrats” (similar to our “Liberal Democrats”) from the Bundestag.
There has always been an in-dominant opposition to a plan for the creation of a federal Europe.
