Snoubridist for an Olympic bill was specially photographed
The Bank of Russia on Wednesday issued a commemorative banknote dedicated to the city of Sochi, where the Olympic Games will be held this in the winter.
Denomination of the bill - 100 rubles.
But in the network of bloggers are already actively ironizing the commemorative banknote.
After the presentation of the Olympic bill on October 30, they drew attention to the fact that the image of the snowboarder from the banknote can be found in the photo banks.
Participated - in the toll-to-clarific repository photos of StockExchange, where this photo is dated in 2005.
The same picture is used in the Photoshop tutorial, published on the Russian website "Mega Review" on January 18, 2011.
In addition, it has already been been used in an advertisement for RugGear.
The Olimpician banknote is made in a blue-blue range.
On the one hand there is a snowboarder flying over Sochi, on the other - the view of the Olympic Stadium and a Firebird.
The author of the design of the banknote is Pavel Bushuyev, who won a competition among students of the St. St. Petersburg Academy of Arts named after Repina.
At the presentation it was noted that several types of sports were considered - alpine, fristil and ski jumping, but in the end they chose a snowboard, since it is a relatively young sport.
According to the Izvestia source close to the Central Bank, it does not matter the opinion of the public about the wide distribution of the image of the snowboarder from the Olympic banknote and is now being studied the situation.
But Goznak is not too concerned about the hype around the Olympic banknote.
The head of the press service Natalia Nikiforova told “Izvestia” that all arguments about plagiarization are funny.
The snowboarder on the banknote will be turned to the right, in the photos on the network - to the left, - said Nikiforova.
The person at a photo shoot to create a bill was filmed from different points, then the final image was chosen, on it - the characteristic posture of a snowboarder.
She also noted that copyright laws do not apply to an Olympic bank, since the artist received a salary for work.
According to the experts, the discussion around the image on an Olympic bill is quite positive.
Recognizability of the image on a bill - a plus for its promotion, - said the Executive Director of NP "USBrand" Alexei Popovichev.
It is quite quite difficult to pronounce an absolute resemblance of images on a bill and in photo banks, so it is unlikely to take lawsuits to challenge the intellectual property for this image.
For the for the first time the Olympic banknote appeared in China - a commemorative banknote of 10 yuan was issued for the Olympic games in Beijing in 2008.
Russia decided to support this tradition.
The legislative prohibitions forced the Russians to drink less beer
Russian breservers are in a bad mood.
According to them, the consumption of beer in the country next this year will remain at the same level, at the best.
Although businessmen initially relied on growth.
After all, this year is unsatisfactory for them: sales fell by 7 percent.
About all of this told the head of one of the world's largest brewing companies, the Chairman of the Council of the Union of Russian breserviers Isaac Sheps at the III annual conference of the Adam Smith Institute "Products of Daily Demand in Russia", which has just ended in Moscow.
It discussed state regulation of the market.
From 2008 to 2012 the Russian beer market has already decreased by 18 percent, since in recent years there has been a significant increase in regulation of the brewing industry in terms of beer production and circulation of beer with a small alcohol content.
In any country of the world there is such a strict restriction of the beer market, an unintellated introduction of more and new illogical prohibitions, which are substantiated allegedly by the fight against the abuse of alcohol.
The breeholder complained that many legislative prohibitions, designed to reduce the level of abusing of alcohol, do not have a special effect, nevertheless, new initiatives are constantly appearing.
The more and more often beer producers was hit by a ban imposed from this year to sell alcohol in kiosks.
“We immediately lost 35 thousand consumers”, – said Isaac Sheps.
For next year b brewers have two forecasts.
Optimistic - the one about which Sheps spoke: the sales of the foam drink will remain at the same level.
pessimistic - will fall by another 2-3 percent.
In order to preserve their profits, businessmen are forced to move away from the varieties designed for the mass-produited consumer to the "premium" class: the beer will become smaller, but it will cost more.
In the meantime, the radical consequences of the fall of sales with a small amount of alcohol are not yet visible.
“According to my observations, the level of diseases of alcoholism remains at about the same level”, – said the narcologist Alexey Sotnikov.
However, the share of patients who use surrogates of strong drinks has increased, as well as those who “sed” on alcohol-containing tonic drinks such as “Jaguar”, while ten years ago it was “beer” alcoholism that predominated.
